1
00:00:01,350 --> 00:00:03,822
What if building a 3D world were as easy as

2
00:00:03,856 --> 00:00:06,210
describing it? Meet BoliVerse.

3
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:10,735
BoliVerse is a voice controlled 3D studio.

4
00:00:10,769 --> 00:00:13,401
Instead of modelling every object by hand,

5
00:00:13,434 --> 00:00:15,374
you describe a world in Hindi,

6
00:00:15,408 --> 00:00:17,774
Marathi, English or Hinglish,

7
00:00:17,808 --> 00:00:19,970
and keep editing it as you speak.

8
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:22,217
Speak on the left.

9
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,537
Your world appears in the centre.

10
00:00:24,570 --> 00:00:27,177
The Inspector on the right shows every object

11
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:28,457
and the environment.

12
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:29,657
Let's build something new,

13
00:00:29,690 --> 00:00:31,270
from an empty scene.

14
00:00:31,833 --> 00:00:34,917
[Builder, Hindi] एक नदी बनाओ और बीस पेड़ लगाओ।
(Make a river, and plant twenty trees.)

15
00:00:36,317 --> 00:00:38,903
Gnani Prisma turns the speech into text.

16
00:00:38,937 --> 00:00:42,043
BoliVerse compiles it into structured commands,

17
00:00:42,077 --> 00:00:43,883
a river and twenty trees,

18
00:00:43,917 --> 00:00:45,243
and builds a real,

19
00:00:45,277 --> 00:00:46,697
editable scene.

20
00:00:48,167 --> 00:00:52,523
[Builder, Hindi] नदी के पास एक मंदिर बनाओ और मंदिर के पास पाँच lamp लगाओ।
(Build a temple near the river, and put five lamps near the temple.)

21
00:00:53,917 --> 00:00:56,603
Places are understood relative to what already

22
00:00:56,637 --> 00:00:59,323
exists. The temple sits beside the river,

23
00:00:59,357 --> 00:01:01,497
and the lamps gather around it.

24
00:01:02,567 --> 00:01:06,275
[Builder, Marathi] नदीवर दगडी पूल बांधा आणि सूर्योदय करा.
(Build a stone bridge over the river, and make it sunrise.)

25
00:01:07,683 --> 00:01:09,170
That was Marathi.

26
00:01:09,203 --> 00:01:11,010
A stone bridge spans the river,

27
00:01:11,043 --> 00:01:13,423
and the sky turns to sunrise.

28
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:17,984
[Builder, English] Put a wooden bench near the temple.

29
00:01:19,383 --> 00:01:22,150
Anything outside the core vocabulary is searched

30
00:01:22,183 --> 00:01:25,043
in a free library of scanned 3D models.

31
00:01:26,533 --> 00:01:28,249
[Builder, Hindi] मंदिर को लाल करो।
(Make the temple red.)

32
00:01:29,650 --> 00:01:31,457
Edits change the same object,

33
00:01:31,490 --> 00:01:34,350
and every step can be undone or redone.

34
00:01:35,433 --> 00:01:36,909
[Builder, Hindi] बारिश शुरू करो।
(Start the rain.)

35
00:01:38,317 --> 00:01:41,243
Weather and time of day change the light,

36
00:01:41,277 --> 00:01:43,897
the sky, and even the wet ground.

37
00:01:46,067 --> 00:01:48,263
[Builder, Hindi] अब bridge तोड़ दो।
(Now break the bridge.)

38
00:01:49,650 --> 00:01:50,648
In Simulate mode,

39
00:01:50,681 --> 00:01:52,636
Rapier physics breaks the bridge into real

40
00:01:52,670 --> 00:01:55,624
debris, and the route system marks the crossing

41
00:01:55,657 --> 00:01:56,670
as blocked.

42
00:01:58,733 --> 00:02:01,961
[Builder, Hindi] steel bridge वापस बनाओ और sunset कर दो।
(Rebuild the bridge in steel, and make it sunset.)

43
00:02:03,350 --> 00:02:05,427
One sentence rebuilds it in steel,

44
00:02:05,460 --> 00:02:06,453
in the same place,

45
00:02:06,486 --> 00:02:08,290
and the route opens again.

46
00:02:10,533 --> 00:02:14,649
[Builder, Hindi] cinematic camera से मंदिर दिखाओ। आठ second का video बनाओ।
(Show the temple with a cinematic camera; make an eight-second video.)

47
00:02:16,050 --> 00:02:18,233
Film mode moves a camera through the same

48
00:02:18,266 --> 00:02:20,549
live world, and exports an MP4,

49
00:02:20,583 --> 00:02:22,350
right in the browser.

50
00:02:23,383 --> 00:02:24,151
Under the hood:

51
00:02:24,184 --> 00:02:26,150
Gnani Prisma for speech,

52
00:02:26,183 --> 00:02:28,248
a multilingual command compiler with Groq

53
00:02:28,282 --> 00:02:30,775
as a fallback, validated commands,

54
00:02:30,808 --> 00:02:33,384
Three.js, Rapier physics,

55
00:02:33,418 --> 00:02:35,763
and Gnani Timbre for spoken replies.

56
00:02:37,597 --> 00:02:39,737
BoliVerse. Your words,

57
00:02:39,770 --> 00:02:40,537
your world.
